aimed at the court in the hage.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.400
It is a call for action, not a judgment already delivered.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:45.280
The case on both sides in Alberta is whether teachers must now handle every contested issue

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.380
without taking a side.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:52.400
Bill 25, an act to remove politics and ideology from classrooms and amend the Education Act,

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.620
took effect this fall.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:58.760
It tells teachers to present all issues in an impartial and neutral way, and it never defines

00:03:58.760 --> 00:03:59.400
either word.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.120
The statute's own case is the title and the rule.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:06.660
Get politics and ideology out of class, and do not have the teacher pick a side.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:16.620
Conor Huey, a full-bright scholar who studied education policy, writes in the Globe and Mail that wanting open, tolerant rooms where students meet a range of views is a fair aim.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:23.260
His case against the bill is that a government which gets to say what counts as ideology ends up censoring, not staying neutral.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:29.480
He says posters can turn into contraband, and that whoever holds power in Edmonton decides which ideas are political.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:36.740
He notes a year of orders pulling books from school library shelves, including a graphic novel version of George Orwell's 1984.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:44.180
Outside groups that give child abuse prevention talks have already had to stop that work in Alberta schools, while they wait on the minister, he writes.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:49.640
So a rule offered as protection has left children with less of it, especially students from marginalized communities.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:58.040
He cite scholars of these policies who have found that neutrality mandates in particular, take away the affirmation and safety those students are supposed to get,

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.800
and make it harder for them to learn.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.980
The Act and Huey's account share this.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.720
The rule is in force, and impartial and neutral are undefined.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.920
On his account, those prevention talks stay off until the minister signs off.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:13.240
